Package: PooGwaM
Type: Package
Title: Validated Multi-Response Regression for Phenotype-Defined Pools
Version: 2.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("Bhargob", "Kakoty", role = "aut"),
    person("Mohammed-Amin", "Madoui", email = "amine.madoui@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Christophe", "Ambroise", role = "aut"))
Description: Fits deterministic regularized regression to allele frequencies
    and multiple phenotypes measured in pools. Provides explicit identifiers,
    quality control, phenotype pooling, formula-based fixed cofactors,
    joint sparse estimation and bounded
    null-model calibration with documented assumptions, including independently
    studentized maximum statistics. Includes experimental pooled knockoff
    selection and optional Manhattan plotting. Exploratory scores are separated
    from calibrated probabilities and conditional selection assumptions.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, tools, graphics
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.2.0), qqman (>= 0.1.9), CMplot (>= 4.5.1)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
